= 0x310, last_value 242. So 0x310 is a heart tile shadow. And 0x312 was from dD. These are HUD shadow bytes.\n\nOK let me disassemble the routine around 0xEEDE. Let me disassemble 0xEEA0 length 128.\n\nActually, maybe simpler: disassemble 0xEED0 length 64.\n\nLet me do 0xEEB0 length 96.\n\nLet me also disassemble 0xEDF0 (pc 0x6DF6 etc). Hmm.\n\nLet me just do 0xEEA0 length 120."}
